{q: "finds the author's style somewhat lacking in warmth?", answer: "A", why: "Próza je „dutiful rather than warm“. U B naopak vzpomínky dodávají „a warmth and immediacy“; v D je text „occasionally lively“.", evidence: "prose that is dutiful rather than warm"},
{q: "singles out the final part of the book for particular praise?", answer: "B", why: "Závěrečná kapitola (návrat do bytu před demolicí) je „as moving a piece of writing as I have read this year“. Ostatní recenze konec knihy nehodnotí.", evidence: "is as moving a piece of writing as I have read this year"}
